#: ../../source/templates_clay.md
msgid "Flat (Level 0)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_clay.md
msgid "No shadow, cream canvas"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_clay.md
msgid "Page background"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_clay.md
msgid "Clay Shadow (Level 1)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_clay.md
msgid ""
"`rgba(0,0,0,0.1) 0px 1px 1px, rgba(0,0,0,0.04) 0px -1px inset, "
"rgba(0,0,0,0.05) 0px -0.5px`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_clay.md
msgid "Cards, buttons — multi-layer with inset highlight"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_clay.md
msgid "Hover Hard (Level 2)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_clay.md
msgid "`rgb(0,0,0) -7px 7px`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_clay.md
msgid "Hover state — playful hard offset shadow"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_clay.md
msgid "Focus (Level 3)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_clay.md
msgid "`rgb(20, 110, 245) solid 2px`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_clay.md
msgid "Keyboard focus ring"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_clay.md:234
msgid ""
"**Shadow Philosophy**: Clay's shadow system is uniquely three-layered: a "
"downward cast (`0px 1px 1px`), an upward inset highlight (`0px -1px 1px "
"inset`), and a subtle edge (`0px -0.5px 1px`). This creates a \"pressed "
"into clay\" quality where elements feel both raised AND embedded — like a"
" clay tablet where content is stamped into the surface. The hover hard "
"shadow (`-7px 7px`) is deliberately retro-graphic, referencing print-era "
"drop shadows and adding physical playfulness."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_clay.md:236
msgid "Decorative Depth"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_clay.md:237
msgid ""
"Full-width swatch-colored sections create dramatic depth through color "
"contrast"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_clay.md:238
msgid "Dashed borders add visual texture alongside solid borders"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_clay.md:239
msgid "Product illustrations with warm, organic art style"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_clay.md:241
msgid "7. Do's and Don'ts"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_clay.md:243
msgid "Do"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_clay.md:244
msgid ""
"Use warm cream (`#faf9f7`) as the page background — the warmth is the "
"identity"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_clay.md:245
msgid ""
"Apply all 5 OpenType stylistic sets on Roobert headings: `\"ss01\", "
"\"ss03\", \"ss10\", \"ss11\", \"ss12\"`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_clay.md:246
msgid ""
"Use the named swatch palette (Matcha, Slushie, Lemon, Ube, Pomegranate, "
"Blueberry) for section backgrounds"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_clay.md:247
msgid ""
"Apply the playful hover animation: `rotateZ(-8deg)`, `translateY(-80%)`, "
"hard shadow `-7px 7px`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_clay.md:248
msgid "Use warm oat borders (`#dad4c8`) — not neutral gray"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_clay.md:249
msgid "Mix solid and dashed borders for visual variety"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_clay.md:250
msgid "Use generous radius: 24px for cards, 40px for sections"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_clay.md:251
msgid "Use weight 600 exclusively for headings, 500 for UI, 400 for body"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_clay.md:253
msgid "Don't"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_clay.md:254
msgid ""
"Don't use cool gray backgrounds — the warm cream (`#faf9f7`) is non-"
"negotiable"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_clay.md:255
msgid ""
"Don't use neutral gray borders (`#ccc`, `#ddd`) — always use the warm oat"
" tones"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_clay.md:256
msgid "Don't mix more than 2 swatch colors in the same section"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_clay.md:257
msgid "Don't skip the OpenType stylistic sets — they define Roobert's character"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_clay.md:258
msgid ""
"Don't use subtle hover effects — the rotation + hard shadow is the "
"signature interaction"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_clay.md:259
msgid ""
"Don't use small border radius (<12px) on feature cards — the generous "
"rounding is structural"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_clay.md:260
msgid ""
"Don't use standard shadows (blur-based) — Clay uses hard offset and "
"multi-layer inset"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_clay.md:261
msgid ""
"Don't forget the uppercase labels with 1.08px tracking — they're the "
"wayfinding system"
msgstr ""

